	(text "J3-J5: optional 2.54 mm breakout headers for bench displays (ILI9341 2.4in, GC9A01A 1.28in). DNP for the car.\nPin order = common ILI9341 module: 3V3 GND CS RST DC MOSI SCK BL TE (module pin 9 SDO lands on TE, harmless).\nBL = backlight MOSFET gate, fed from the PWM pin via the 470R: for a module BL/LED transistor input, not LED anodes.\nFit either the FPC display or a breakout per channel, not both. Keep each header within ~10 mm of its FPC connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb0d7a99-c809-410f-abb3-94526e669bd4")
	)
